@startuml
title Activity Diagram: UC-06 Manage Order

|Customer|
start
:Select product(s) from catalog & add to cart\n(optionally attaching custom cake design);

|System|
:Update and display Shopping Cart contents\nand running total;
:Perform stock check to confirm all items\nand ingredients are in stock;

if (All items/ingredients available?) then (Yes)
  |Customer|
  :Proceed to Checkout Page, enter delivery details,\ncontact info, and payment method;
  :Confirm order details and submit order;

  |System|
  :Create order record with status "Pending"\nand forward to Order History Page / POS portal;
  :Perform Process Payment use case\n(e.g., GCash, Maya, COD);

  if (Payment successful?) then (Yes)
    :Notify Staff/Admin of new order;

    |Staff/Admin|
    :Open Order History Page from Dashboard,\nreview new order, and click "Accept" or "Reject";

    if (Accept order?) then (Yes)
      |System|
      :Update order status to "Confirmed";
      :Notify customer;

      |Staff/Admin|
      :Update order status as prepared\n("In Preparation", "Ready");
      :Mark order as "Picked Up" / "Delivered"\n(Delivery Driver role);

      |System|
      :Reflect real-time status update on customer's\norder-tracking page & timestamp delivery;

      |Customer|
      :Receive order and view completed status;

    else (No - Rejected)
      |System|
      :Update order status to "Rejected";
      :Notify customer of rejection;
      :Perform Manage Inventory to release reserved stock;
    endif

  else (No - Payment Failed)
    |System|
    :Notify customer payment failed;
    
    |Customer|
    :Choose to retry with same/different method\nor cancel order;
  endif

else (No - Unavailable Items)
  |System|
  :Flag unavailable item(s) and notify customer\nwith substitute or cancellation options;

  |Customer|
  :Choose substitute or cancel order;
endif

|System|
stop
@enduml
